":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lqVixehYkSWxOsSiADDwRxoeuDA.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lqVixehYkSWxOsSiADDwRxoeuDA.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/76472/season/1/episode/14"},{"id":"1420417","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":15,"title":{"value":"Il teatro sotterraneo","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"ビルの地下にある喫茶店跡を劇場に「石の微笑」は初日の幕を開ける。観客はわずか12名。しかし客席には、姫川亜弓と真島良の姿があった。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1984-07-16","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qXXOfmHmWgdKPxrPsUZkJWRkcrL.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qXXOfmHmWgdKPxrPsUZkJWRkcrL.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/76472/season/1/episode/15"},{"id":"1420418","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":16,"title":{"value":"L'immagine della mamma","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"最終日、バスの窓から母の姿を見たマヤの心は乱れ、不覚にも舞台の上で涙を流してしまう。そんなマヤに千草は謹慎を言い渡す…","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1984-07-23","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/eVBEA57WxXSjuQ128H9MhSdhh7I.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eVBEA57WxXSjuQ128H9MhSdhh7I.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/76472/season/1/episode/16"},{"id":"1420419","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":17,"title":{"value":"Dov'è l'amico delle rose?","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"亜弓主演の舞台「夢宴桜」に急遽出演することになったマヤだったが、台本がすり替えられ、ピンチに。しかし亜弓は機転をきかせマヤもこの危機に挑んでいく…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1984-07-30","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/f6FAEyEDAFPM9ccZGrDPN4djuyL.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/f6FAEyEDAFPM9ccZGrDPN4djuyL.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/76472/season/1/episode/17"},{"id":"1420420","sea